Because this repository bundles copyrighted assets the author does not own,
no open-source license is applied to the repository as a whole. You may read,
fork, and adapt the code for personal use, but you should be aware that:

  - The Clawd character and related visual assets remain Anthropic's property.
  - The pixel-art sprites remain @amaanbuilds's work.
  - Redistributing this project with those assets may infringe third-party
    copyrights. Use your own judgement and obtain appropriate permissions
    before any commercial or large-scale redistribution.

You have been warned.
